---
layout: base.njk
title: Claude plays Doom
description: An LLM plays Doom in your browser, one screenshot at a time.
permalink: /doom/index.html
extraStyles:
  - /css/landing-page.css
  - https://v8.js-dos.com/latest/js-dos.css
---
<section class="py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="mb-2">Claude plays Doom</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Each turn the game freezes, a screenshot goes to Claude, and it picks a move and jots a short note to itself for the next turn. It works the title menus itself; the page's one helper is that after every forward move it taps the use key, so walking into a door opens it.</p>
    <div class="doom-settings mb-3" aria-label="Game settings">
      <label>Model
        <select id="doom-model" class="form-control form-control-sm">
          <option value="haiku">Haiku 4.5</option>
          <option value="sonnet">Sonnet 5</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <p id="doom-hint" class="small text-muted mb-0 doom-hint"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="doom-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="doom-stage"><div id="dos" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/10;"></div></div>
        <button id="doom-toggle" class="btn btn-primary mt-3" disabled>Let Claude play</button>
        <div id="doom-cost" class="small text-muted mt-2"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>What it's thinking</h5>
        <ul id="doom-log" class="list-unstyled small" style="max-height:420px; overflow:auto;"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.DOOM_CONFIG = {
    bundleUrl: "/doom/doom.jsdos",
    proxyUrl: "https://bgcxjj324xcfvxmsfpbv627pp40xhisu.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws/",
    maxSteps: 150,
    budgetUsd: 1,
  };
</script>
<script src="https://v8.js-dos.com/latest/js-dos.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/doom-agent.js"></script>
<style>
  #doom-log .err { color: #c0392b; }
  #doom-log .note { color: #1e6fd9; }
  .doom-settings { display: grid; gap: .75rem 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); align-items: end; }
  .doom-settings label { margin: 0; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .doom-hint { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .doom-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  @media (min-width: 992px) { .doom-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
